# NQ00Karick "Karicks Helmproblem": the miner Karick has an old helmet stuck on his head. Soap from the stores on the mine
# wall frees it, but the guards will not hand it over while the mages watch, so the player provokes a mage into
# shelling the wall and picks the soap up off the ground. This quest gates the main quest: MQ01Tate's script
# (TateScript) does nothing past the first greeting until NQ00Karick >= 19, and its Tate-gate lines (Branick, the mage
# attack) need NQ00Karick 25.
# Stages are TES4 numbers: 5 Karick stumbles in, 10 told, 15 Merre/Porim sent the player to the guards, 19 Tate's
# answer, 20 mages hittable, 21 mage hit, 25 Tate warns, 30 two Seife, 35 soap given, 40 thanked.

# Karick's greeting at stage 5 ("Ihr, Ihr! Koennt Ihr mir helfen?"); "Helmproblem" (NQ00KarickTopic01) sets stage 10 and
# adds the topic "Seife" to Merre and Porim.
case karick_helmet
walk Karickref
talk Karickref
hear 300 Karickref Helmproblem
ask "Helmproblem"
bye
expect GetStageDone NQ00Karick 10
end

# Merre's greeting (INFO 001AB968) adds "Seife"; in SchattenrufMinePart07 at stage 10 his "Seife" answer sets stage 15
# and gives Tate the topic.
case karick_merre_suggests_soap
talk MerreRef
hear 300 MerreRef Karick
ask "Seife"
hear 300 MerreRef Seife... mmh
bye
expect GetStageDone NQ00Karick 15
end

# Out of the mine (door 0000E5CF) to Tate on the wall. His "Seife" answer (INFO 0000A5D3) sets stage 19; MQ01TateScript
# then has Branick call down from the wall ("Die Seife ist hier oben ...", NQ00Soldat01) and 9.5 s later sets stage 20,
# which makes the mages hittable (NQ00MagierScript).
case karick_tate_refuses
walk 0000E5CF
activate 0000E5CF
until 600 player.GetInCell SchattenrufMinePart07 == 0
walk WachsoldatTateRef
talk WachsoldatTateRef
ask "Seife"
hear 300 WachsoldatTate Seife, was
bye
expect GetStageDone NQ00Karick 19
hear 900 WachsoldatBranickRef Die Seife ist hier oben
until 1200 GetStageDone NQ00Karick 20
end

# The player attacks one of the mages (MQ01Kampfmagier0N); NQ00MagierScript sees GetAttacked, the mages stop, two
# fireballs hit the wall and stage 21 is set. A spell the player casts at the mage stands in for the player's attack
# (Nehrim's own 1Feuerball, Rank I; the player's starting DefaultPlayerSpell only restores health). MQ01TateScript then
# has Tate warn the player ("Mist! Volle Deckung!") and sets stage 25.
case karick_provoke_mage
walk MQ01Kampfmagier01Ref
console player.cast 1Feuerball MQ01Kampfmagier01Ref
until 600 GetStageDone NQ00Karick 21
hear 600 WachsoldatTate Volle Deckung
until 900 GetStageDone NQ00Karick 25
end

# The shelling shook soap loose onto the ground below the wall; two pieces (NQ00KarickScript counts Seife >= 2) set
# stage 30. The soap are placed refs without EditorIDs (0000A476, 0000A475); where they ended up is physics.
case karick_collect_soap
walk 0000A476
take 0000A476
walk 0000A475
take 0000A475
until 300 GetStageDone NQ00Karick 30
expect player.GetItemCount Seife >= 2
end

# Back to Karick: "Seife" (INFO 0000B47F) sets stage 35 and takes the soap; his next greeting (INFO 0000B481, "Es hat
# geklappt!") sets stage 40.
case karick_soap_given
walk 00001BC2
activate 00001BC2
until 600 player.GetInCell SchattenrufMinePart07
walk Karickref
talk Karickref
ask "Seife"
hear 300 Karickref Ihr habt Seife
bye
expect GetStageDone NQ00Karick 35
expect player.GetItemCount Seife == 0
talk Karickref
hear 300 Karickref Es hat geklappt
bye
expect GetStageDone NQ00Karick 40
end
